   "design": "Field observations recorded on tablet forms in s1 land in the area database, and plan tables come from a query, instead of typing field sheets into spreadsheets. Background sections start from a draft whose figures and rules must trace to sources. The plan template fills tables and standard map layouts. Reviewers comment in one shared document. Field visits, consultation, yield calculations, objectives and measures stay with the biologist.",
